@startuml
actor "用户 (User)" as User
participant "AnalysisController" as Ctrl
participant "AnalysisServiceImpl" as Svc
participant "外部AI分析服务\n(Python/Gemini)" as AI
database "MySQL" as DB

== 股票分析生成 (FR-06) ==

User -> Ctrl: POST /api/analysis/{stockCode}
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc: generateAnalysis(userId, stockCode)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: 查询最新 K 线及行情数据
activate DB
DB --> Svc: 返回行情数据
deactivate DB

Svc -> AI: 推送行情数据，请求生成情绪摘要
activate AI
AI --> Svc: 返回情绪分析报告
deactivate AI

Svc -> DB: 写入 ai_analysis 表
Svc --> Ctrl: 返回分析结果
Ctrl --> User: 返回分析报告 (JSON)
deactivate Svc
deactivate Ctrl

== 上下文问答 (FR-07) ==

User -> Ctrl: POST /api/analysis/{stockCode}/qa\n(携带用户问题)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc: askQuestion(userId, stockCode, question)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: 查询最新 ai_analysis 作为上下文
activate DB
DB --> Svc: 返回已有分析记录
deactivate DB

Svc -> AI: 以分析结果为背景上下文\n发送用户问题
activate AI
AI --> Svc: 返回问答回复
deactivate AI

Svc -> DB: 写入 qa_history 表
Svc --> Ctrl: 返回问答结果
Ctrl --> User: 返回回答内容 (JSON)
deactivate Svc
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml
